{"hero":{"id":79,"name":"Rem","nameRu":"Дрём","className":"hero_familiar","description":"Случайно попав к нам из мира снов, Дрём застрял в городе, который никогда не спит. Движимый любопытством, он бродит по пяти районам города со своими верными помощниками в поисках пути домой.<br><br>Так что если вы вдруг задремали на Синей ветке метро по дороге с работы, быть может, вам просто повстречались новые обитатели Проклятого яблока.","descriptionEn":"An accidental stowaway from the world of dreams, Rem has found himself stranded in the city that never sleeps.  Driven by his curious nature, Rem and his helpful friends have been seen wandering across the five boroughs in search of a way back home.<br><br>So if you ever find yourself dozing off while taking the Blue line home from work, maybe you've just had an encounter with one of the Cursed Apple's newest denizens.","lore":"An accidental stowaway from the world of dreams, Rem has found himself stranded in the city that never sleeps.  Driven by his curious nature, Rem and his helpful friends have been seen wandering across the five boroughs in search of a way back home.<br><br>So if you ever find yourself dozing off while taking the Blue line home from work, maybe you've just had an encounter with one of the Cursed Apple's newest denizens.","heroRole":"","tags":["Подмога","Кроха","Хр-р-р"],"heroType":"","complexity":3,"colorHex":"#5383D1","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/familiar_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/familiar_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":7.2,"sprint_speed":4,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":58,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":680,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":3,"base_health_regen":2,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.222222,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_damage_re