r: #CE90FF;\">spirit resist</span> and fading <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"#0F9\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M81.5143 72.4711L117.08 34.3552L68.8057 2L57.0343 31.8506L11 87.2257L34.7257 103.141L43.3657 96.9254L58.4286 118.989L83.2514 124.977L108.646 125L114.269 116.666L95.96 103.665L81.5143 72.4711Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"inline-attribute-label MoveSpeed\" style=\"color: #0F9;\">move speed</span>.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Follow a trooper:</span> Provides <span class=\"highlight\">healing, damage, resists, and allows tagging along.</span> When no hero is around, souls from trooper kills are split amongst the team.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Can be cast during Tag Along. Helpers will take a nap for 15.1s after following someone.</span>","descriptionRu":"Дрём даёт помощнику задание. Помощник может собирать награды из ящиков и автоматов Sinner's Sacrifice, а также следовать за союзниками или солдатами.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">При следовании за героем:</span> помощник ненадолго даёт <img src=\"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/property_tech_armor.png\" class=\"inline-attribute SpiritResist\" alt=\"сопротивляемость спиритизму\"/><span class=\"inline-attribute-label SpiritResist\" style=\"color: #CE90FF;\">сопротивляемость спиритизму</span> и затухающий бонус к <panel class=\"InlineAttributeIcon MoveSpeed\" replacechar=\"_\"><span class=\"MoveSpeed\">скорости передвижения</span>.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">При следовании за солдатом:</span> помощник даёт <span class=\"highlight\">лечение, бонус к урону и сопротивляемостям, а также позволяет применить на солдата «Приятную компанию».</span> Если поблизости нет героя, души с убитых солдат распределяются между членами команды.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Можно применить во время действия «Приятной компании». После следования помощники отходят поспать на 15.1 сек.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"1568845221","name":"Tag Along","nameRu":"Приятная компания","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/familiar/familiar_tag_along.png","className":"ability_familiar_attach","description":"Jump to an ally and nap alongside them. Both you and the ally receive a burst <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"#0F9\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M92.0059 9C107.475 9.00022 120 22.237 120 38.6592C120 68.2957 85.5894 87.6846 66.6162 116.752C65.1163 119.062 62.8837 119.062 61.3838 116.752C42.4106 87.6846 8.00022 68.2957 8 38.6592C8 22.2808 20.5245 9.00022 35.9941 9C40.2312 9.02587 44.4049 10.0351 48.1855 11.9482C49.3884 12.5569 50.5406 13.2524 51.6343 14.0271C52.9137 14.9332 52.473 16.8509 51.0109 17.4168C37.5479 22.6271 28 35.6977 28 51C28 70.8823 44.1177 87 64 87C83.8823 87 100 70.8823 100 51C100 35.6974 90.4516 22.6267 76.9882 17.4167C75.5261 16.8509 75.0854 14.9333 76.3648 14.0273C77.4588 13.2526 78.6113 12.557 79.8145 11.9482C83.5951 10.0351 87.7688 9.02587 92.0059 9Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n<path d=\"M69 46H84V56H69V71H59V56H44V46H59V31H69V46Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"inline-attribute-label Heal\" style=\"color: #0F9;\">heal</span> based on missing health followed by lingering <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"#0F9\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M92.0059 9C107.475 9.00022 120 22.237 120 38.6592C120 68.2957 85.5894 87.6846 66.6162 116.752C65.1163 119.062 62.8837 119.062 61.3838 116.752C42.4106 87.6846 8.00022 68.2957 8 38.6592C8 22.2808 20.5245 9.00022 35.9941 9C40.2312 9.02587 44.4049 10.0351 48.1855 11.9482C49.3884 12.5569 50.5406 13.2524 51.6343 14.0271C52.9137 14.9332 52.473 16.8509 51.0109 17.4168C37.5479 22.6271 28 35.6977 28 51C28 70.8823 44.1177 87 64 87C83.8823 87 100 70.8823 100 51C100 35.6974 90.4516 22.6267 76.9882 17.4167C75.5261 16.8509 75.0854 14.9333 76.3648 14.0273C77.4588 13.2526 78.6113 12.557 79.8145 11.9482C83.5951 10.0351 87.7688 9.02587 92.0059 9Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n<path d=\"M69 46H84V56H69V71H59V56H44V46H59V31H69V46Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"inline-attribute-label Regen\" style=\"color: #0F9;\">regeneration</span>.<br><br>Hop between allies with Ability 2 to apply the heal, once per ally.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">You are knocked off if stunned by an ultimate ability.<br>You can use items and all self-casts target your ally instead.</span>","descriptionRu":"Дрём прыгает к союзнику и дремлет возле него. Дрём и союзник получают мгновенное <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"#0F9\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M92.0059 9C107.475 9.00022 120 22.237 120 38.6592C120 68.2957 85.5894 87.6846 66.6162 116.752C65.1163 119.062 62.8837 119.062 61.3838 116.752C42.4106 87.6846 8.00022 68.2957 8 38.6592C8 22.2808 20.5245 9.00022 35.9941 9C40.2312 9.02587 44.4049 10.0351 48.1855 11.9482C49.3884 12.5569 50.5406 13.2524 51.6343 14.0271C52.9137 14.9332 52.473 16.8509 51.0109 17.4168C37.5479 22.6271 28 35.6977 28 51C28 70.8823 44.1177 87 64 87C83.8823 87 100 70.8823 100 51C100 35.6974 90.4516 22.6267 76.9882 17.4167C75.5261 16.8509 75.0854 14.9333 76.3648 14.0273C77.4588 13.2526 78.6113 12.557 79.8145 11.9482C83.5951 10.0351 87.7688 9.02587 92.0059 9Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n<path d=\"M69 46H84V56H69V71H59V56H44V46H59V31H69V46Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"inline-attribute-label Heal\" style=\"color: #0F9;\">лечение</span>, пропорциональное их недостающему здоровью, а также постепенное <svg width=\"128\" height=\"128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" fill=\"#0F9\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M92.0059 9C107.475 9.00022 120 22.237 120 38.6592C120 68.2957 85.5894 87.6846 66.6162 116.752C65.1163 119.062 62.8837 119.062 61.3838 116.752C42.4106 87.6846 8.00022 68.2957 8 38.6592C8 22.2808 20.5245 9.00022 35.9941 9C40.2312 9.02587 44.4049 10.0351 48.1855 11.9482C49.3884 12.5569 50.5406 13.2524 51.6343 14.0271C52.9137 14.9332 52.473 16.8509 51.0109 17.4168C37.5479 22.6271 28 35.6977 28 51C28 70.8823 44.1177 87 64 87C83.8823 87 100 70.8823 100 51C100 35.6974 90.4516 22.6267 76.9882 17.4167C75.5261 16.8509 75.0854 14.9333 76.3648 14.0273C77.4588 13.2526 78.6113 12.557 79.8145 11.9482C83.5951 10.0351 87.7688 9.02587 92.0059 9Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n<path d=\"M69 46H84V56H69V71H59V56H44V46H59V31H69V46Z\" fill=\"#0F9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"inline-attribute-label Regen\" style=\"color: #0F9;\">восстановление</span>.<br><br>Прыгайте между целями нажатием 2-е умение , чтобы лечить их — по разу на каждого союзника.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Дрём падает, если его оглушает ульт.<br>Дрём может использовать предметы, но при применении на себя эффекты будут наложены на союзника.</span>","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_abilit